    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Met you on a Saturday, knew it was somethin' soon as you spoke it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Eye fuckin' across the table, don't think anybody noticed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You asked me if I was comin' to city you from",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Maybe we should kick it, I was interested, that would be dumb",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "If I denied long legs, good ears, great taste",
          "rhyme": "ast",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Smell good, sense of humor, obvious a good face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And we clicked, we was at each other's hips",
          "rhyme": "ips",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I ain't even wanna fuck 'cause your presence was enough",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "You and I make sense, you stayed back at my telly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "We was chattin' 'til mornin', the vibrations was heavy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I wasn't drownin' or yawnin', that's when I told you my feelings",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "You told me you felt the same, but you got homie you dealin' with",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Damn, I didn't know, that's a bit unexpected",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "But I get it, it's whatever, least I can do is respect it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "We still gon' kick it and check-in like nothin' could ever stop it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The problem is he my friend, but if I'm honest, I'm really hopin' you drop him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "It's morals I really have, it's lines I could never cross",
          "rhyme": "Os",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "But you got somethin' that make all them good intentions get lost",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "I try to keep it together, never felt this way",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "We spent 'bout two weeks together, only skipped one day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "And they say, \"Bros over hoes,\" I'm like, \"Mm, nah, hey\"",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I would rather hold your hand than have a cool handshake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "But whatever, we still could be friends, it could still be chance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I'ma play it cool, we got somethin', we cannot pretend, uh, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHIIJABAAKLMBNNOPQ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEEACAAAABAAACCBFFFGH"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's, it's like starting a race",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And then when you take off, they like, \"No, no, it's not a end,\" ha",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It was too late and shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "FaceTimin', it ain't 'bout nothin', you laughin', packin' your luggage",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's nothin' incriminatin', but please delete our discussions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You hit me with the look and replied like, \"Duh, bitch\"",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Don't want your man to think that we creepin' behind his back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Cross the line, cross the line, cross the— nah, we never did that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Though I haven't seen him in months, shit is rare he never hit back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Anyway, convince him to bring you to me so we could kick it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Right in front of his lenses, nothing here is malicious",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "You sat by me in that movie, we went outside for them doobies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "We walkin' off when we talk, man, that nigga not fuckin' stupid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He see it, he know it's somethin' we frontin' like, \"Ha-ha-ha\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Whenever we \"Ha-ha-ha,\" we subtly press his buttons",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Not on purpose, but, man, I found my purpose",
          "rhyme": "oz",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "If I fucked our friendship up for you, I think it's worth it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "But, nah, I can't do that, that nigga don't deserve it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And plus y'all got depth, I'm just the nigga on the surface, for real",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Surface",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEDFGHEEBIFFJK",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCAAACDCAABECCCA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I said surface, like, 'cause they got roots",
          "rhyme": "uts",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Like, I'm the new nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But you know, they be fuckin', haha",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yeah, yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Didn't see you a couple weeks, think he want you away from me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Know y'all argued 'bout if you mad you met him before you met me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I feel guilty, but not as much as I should",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I tried to have that self-control, but not as much as I could",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I been down for days, you in my city and I can't see your face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I can't eat knowin' you with him and not at my place",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I never been jealous of another man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Especially when I have everything I want at hand",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Except you, you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABBCCDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCCDDE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You know, I got every damn car, multiple cribs",
          "rhyme": "ib",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But it's like, \"No, I want that,\" ha",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_7",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "He left for some days, I cleared out my sched', I cleared out my head",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You dropped off at mine, I say that we fled, \"No, you pick a place\"",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "We could Tulum, or we could Capri, or die right here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "As long as you with me, I'll be at peace, huh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You was supposed to go back home to see your bestie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I told you I can't hit that zone, too busy next week",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You was like, \"Hmm, I'll stay a week, she'll get over that\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Seven days with me, your nigga like, \"Where the fuck you at?\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Dirtyin' my bakin' pots, tennis at my mama spot",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Chauffeured in the Rolls, the back entrance for them restaurants",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Parks playin' chess games, givin' wigs pet names",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Manicures, night swims, Jerrod providin' methane",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Shoppin' 'til we droppin', what you coppin'?",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "See, the price is not a option",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "It's investments 'cause your smile is the profit to me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I know around him, you gotta act like you not into me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I know your answer, but you gotta keep it honest with me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Said you can't fully be into me 'cause you with him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Then why the fuck when we link it's like he doesn't exist?",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "They all know that we friends, but we both aware that it's more",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Everything I got, if you say the word, then it's yours",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "The only thing I'm missin' in life, I know you could be it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "And everyone around me that care about me can see it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I could fuck a trillion bitches every country I done been in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Men or women, it don't matter, if I seen 'em, then I had 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "But with you, it's a feeling 'cause we twinnin' and we matchin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "You stayed in the car when I went on date with that actress",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Whole time I'm eatin', I couldn't wait to get back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "In the back of the car with you and talk about who we are",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "You told me when you with me, it's like heroin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Told me that your confidence went up since we befriended, and",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Told me that you didn't wanna hurt him, why we doin' this?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Told me this a awkward situation and you just wanna be through with it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Told me every time you not with him, it started problems, and",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Told me every time you not with me, you always ponder",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "What type of sweater I'm wearin', what music have I been finding",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Girl, you know that I'ma play it whenever, that's what we bonded over",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "You said you told him the truth and you never lied",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Now he lookin' at you with them eyes",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "We never crossed the line, but he got every right to be a lil' pissed off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "He picked you up, y'all got an argument, he got his shit off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "My energy like, \"Get lost,\" your energy just want peace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "I couldn't even tell you his energy 'cause he don't speak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "He ain't even call you his bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Until he see me make you smile, that nigga threatened as shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "I'm in the wrong, though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "I picked you up, your energy off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Your lips really dry, something is off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "You ask if I gotta, I ask if you gotta",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "We trip on our words, nobody is lyin', hakuna matata",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "We sat in the car and cried for a hour",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "My shirt look like a showerhead got it, we called it off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "I'll skip the details but that night I seen hell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "You was in a room I was payin' for, I took three Ls",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "No, I didn't sleep well, woke up and my knees fell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "They buckled to the ground, I cannot walk, shit, I need Vill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "Next day I'm drivin' 'round the city with no destination back-up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "Water in my eyes kept falling like Niagara",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "Vill right beside me makin' sure I didn't crash or",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "Do something heinous 'cause I'm emotionally jabbed up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "You checked every box, I thought it was it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "Felt like I got led on and pushed off a cliff",
          "rhyme": "if",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "No, I'm in the wrong, that was a friend",
          "rhyme": ")d",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "No, fuck that, the energy we had, never again will find it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "64",
          "text": "You in the wrong, gotta remind you 'bout the times that you stepped",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "65",
          "text": "Gotta rewind it— aw, fuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "66",
          "text": "We talkin' 'bout our kinks, real cautious with the links",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "67",
          "text": "You don't do that type of shit when you in relationship",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "68",
          "text": "And you a hundred with your mate, so don't go actin' like no saint",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "69",
          "text": "'Cause it's a two-way street, and shit, you knew what I was on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "70",
          "text": "And while that nigga out and gone, shit, you was loungin' in my home",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "71",
          "text": "Shit, I even let you meet my mama and y'all got along",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "72",
          "text": "But shit, I'll take my L, though it's not fun",
          "rhyme": "yn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "73",
          "text": "You still got your nigga and still had your fun",
          "rhyme": "yn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "74",
          "text": "Shit, I can't even look at you and think about bad words",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "75",
          "text": "That's why I called and said we couldn't end this on bad terms",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "76",
          "text": "We straight like a bad perm, we'll always be good friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "77",
          "text": "And laugh about it on a sandy beach while our back burns, huh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "78",
          "text": "This my perspective, this how I feel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "79",
          "text": "I ain't fabricate nothin', I kept it real",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "80",
          "text": "I told you I love you and always will",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "81",
          "text": "And if he ever put his hands on you, promise I'll get him killed, true",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "82",
          "text": "True, true, true, yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGGHIJKLMNNNOPQRSSTUTVWXLIESIYZY[\\]]B^_S`]]GGR]aaabcGQcSdeSYfghLMiMjjQkIDabblm",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEEBBFGBBHIJJJEEFDEEEAEABBHGEEGCECEAFFBAEEFFFBBDFAAAEKBFKEEHECLHEHIMILLFFGDAEELA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_8",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "On God, I love that girl, f— mhm",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm a sh— I'm a bad person, like, I'm in the wrong, I'm a bad person",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I had no ill intentions, though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Shit, everybody got hurt",
          "rhyme": "uRt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I got hurt, bruh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It's a shit situation",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "All the morals and power you have just vanish when a certain energy is nearing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And those feelings got so much gravity and it's out of your control",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "That made me realize adults don't know what they doin' either",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "We're all just children",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I ain't mean to fuck nobody's shit up, man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I thought I was bulletproof",
          "rhyme": "uf",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "She proved me wrong, man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I felt two hundred percent with her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "It was beautiful",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I was able to feel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "But it was, it was bad timing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "And I'm mad private with this side of my life 'cause people are weirdos, and",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "I just try to keep anyone I care about in the shadows",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Safe from the commentary and spotlight and thoughts",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "'Cause it's just a story for the people outside of it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "But I guess you're just another chapter in the book",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHIJKLKMNOGKPQRS",
